  m_text: '<size=17>

    -  3 or more scattered            on Base Game reels triggers
    the Epic Bonus Feature.


    -  3 Epic Bonus Spins are awarded.


    -  Triggering          
    and any locked symbols from Bonus Reels are locked in position.


    -  All
    other positions turn into individual spinning reels.


    -  Epic Bonus Feature
    is played on 6 position high reels. 3 rows are initially active.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
