    -  Awards Credits.

    -  Locked in position.



    - 
    Activates the next adjacent inactive row.

    -  Disappears after the activation.

    - 
    Does not appear when all rows are active.


    -  Increases maximum Epic Bonus
    spin by 1.

    -  Disappears after the activation.

    -  Only appears once
    in an Epic Bonus Feature.


    -  Upgrades random 1 to 3          ,          
    ,  or           .

    -  Disappears after the activation.





    - Collects
    Credits from           in active rows once.




    - Collects Credits from          
    in active rows every spin.

