  m_text: "<size=17>\n-  Any Epic Bonus symbols or Treasure Chest is activated only
    when its row is active.\r\n\n-  If additional Epic Bonus symbol or Treasure Chest
    land in an active position, the number of remaining Epic Bonus spins is reset
    to its maximum.\r\n\n-  When all active rows are full, the next adjacent inactive
    row is activated.\r\n\n-  When all 30 positions are full, special           
    is awarded which only gives Mega Jackpot or Grand Jackpot.\r"
